    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0365" n="267" xml:id="pg267"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Goodnow to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japanese consul-general informs me Japanese Government has ordered withdrawal the
                    marines landed in native city of Amoy, and will withdraw from island when
                    satisfied order will be kept.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goodnow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
